<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><fdroid><repo icon="icon.png" name="Sovereign Edge" pubkey="" timestamp="1792201712" url="https://frenchtoastbig7-ux.github.io/fdroid/repo" version="20002"><description>Apps by Sovereign Edge Inc. for GrapheneOS and Pixel. Pocket Agent, a private on-device Claude agent; Pocket Pantry, a pantry, grocery cart and Claude recipes app; Pocket Concierge, an offline HTML itinerary viewer with Claude; and Pocket Coach, an open-source strength training app with spreadsheet plan import.</description></repo><application id="com.sovereignedge.pocketagent"><id>com.sovereignedge.pocketagent</id><added>2026-09-14</added><lastupdated>2026-09-14</lastupdated><name>Pocket Agent</name><summary>Private on-device Claude agent with memory, skills and automations</summary><desc>Pocket Agent is a personal assistant that runs on your phone and uses Claude as its model. It is built for GrapheneOS and talks to exactly one server: Anthropic's API.

What it can do, with your permission:
* Read and send SMS, look up contacts, read and add calendar events, read the call log and recent notifications
* Read and write files in a private workspace folder
* Search and read the web
* Read the screen and tap, type and scroll in other apps (accessibility service)
* Remember you across chats (MEMORY.md / USER.md), write reusable skills, and search past chats
* Run scheduled automations that report back in a private notification
* Split research into parallel read-only sub-agents

Anything that sends, taps, types or changes data is shown to you for approval first. Scheduled runs are read-only. The API key is encrypted with the Android Keystore. There are no analytics and no Google Play Services.

You need your own Anthropic API key.</desc><license>Apache-2.0</license><categories>AI Chat</categories><category>AI Chat</category><web></web><source>https://github.com/frenchtoastbig7-ux/pocket-agent</source><tracker>https://github.com/frenchtoastbig7-ux/pocket-agent/issues</tracker><author>Sovereign Edge Inc.</author><marketversion></marketversion><marketvercode>2</marketvercode><antifeatures>NonFreeNet</antifeatures><package><version>0.2.0</version><versioncode>2</versioncode><apkname>com.sovereignedge.pocketagent_2.apk</apkname><hash type="sha256">56d48eca9d31d62dc61100fe936f4d211076d23058fb25293e49bc13e8045a01</hash><size>26256467</size><sdkver>33</sdkver><targetSdkVersion>36</targetSdkVersion><added>2026-09-14</added><sig>0210478b3ee16334d75ed5c7273bf544</sig><permissions>ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE,FOREGROUND_SERVICE,FOREGROUND_SERVICE_SPECIAL_USE,INTERNET,POST_NOTIFICATIONS,READ_CALENDAR,READ_CALL_LOG,READ_CONTACTS,READ_SMS,RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED,RECORD_AUDIO,SCHEDULE_EXACT_ALARM,SEND_SMS,WRITE_CALENDAR,com.sovereignedge.pocketagent.DYNAMIC_RECEIVER_NOT_EXPORTED_PERMISSION</permissions><nativecode>arm64-v8a,armeabi-v7a,x86,x86_64</nativecode></package><package><version>0.1.0</version><versioncode>1</versioncode><apkname>com.sovereignedge.pocketagent_1.apk</apkname><hash type="sha256">5c5f2f3f873c089d1f7a1cb68603f4d5790eeb50e8b9b81cf4954493ae1c07da</hash><size>24583314</size><sdkver>33</sdkver><targetSdkVersion>36</targetSdkVersion><added>2026-09-14</added><sig>0210478b3ee16334d75ed5c7273bf544</sig><permissions>ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE,FOREGROUND_SERVICE,FOREGROUND_SERVICE_SPECIAL_USE,INTERNET,POST_NOTIFICATIONS,READ_CALENDAR,READ_CALL_LOG,READ_CONTACTS,READ_SMS,RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED,RECORD_AUDIO,SCHEDULE_EXACT_ALARM,SEND_SMS,WRITE_CALENDAR,com.sovereignedge.pocketagent.DYNAMIC_RECEIVER_NOT_EXPORTED_PERMISSION</permissions><nativecode>arm64-v8a,armeabi-v7a,x86,x86_64</nativecode></package></application><application id="com.sovereignedge.pocketcoach"><id>com.sovereignedge.pocketcoach</id><added>2026-10-16</added><lastupdated>2026-10-17</lastupdated><name>Pocket Coach</name><summary>Strength training programs, set logging, 1RM tracking and spreadsheet plan import</summary><desc>Pocket Coach is an open-source strength and conditioning app in the spirit of TrainHeroic: a coach writes a program, the athlete follows it day by day, logs every set and watches their numbers move.

* Today: a week strip with the session your program puts on each day, one tap from starting
* Programs: weeks x days of sessions made of blocks (supersets) with per-set prescriptions as % of 1RM, RPE or a fixed load
* Workout logging with targets already turned into kilos or pounds, a rest timer and automatic estimated one-rep maxes
* Library of about 90 exercises plus your own, each with a 1RM, an e1RM chart and full history
* Progress: totals, a 12-week volume chart, records and history
* Import a training plan from a CSV or Excel spreadsheet, or a Pocket Coach program file; export programs to share with athletes

Everything stays on the phone: no account, no server, no analytics, and the app has no network permission.</desc><license>Apache-2.0</license><categories>Sports &amp; Health</categories><category>Sports &amp; Health</category><web></web><source>https://github.com/frenchtoastbig7-ux/pocket-coach</source><tracker>https://github.com/frenchtoastbig7-ux/pocket-coach/issues</tracker><author>Sovereign Edge Inc.</author><marketversion></marketversion><marketvercode>6</marketvercode><package><version>0.6.0</version><versioncode>6</versioncode><apkname>com.sovereignedge.pocketcoach_6.apk</apkname><hash type="sha256">e99832cf34af83c229b4464d17d0b90f2614b1dad4c010d2d0753e74a45468f4</hash><size>3993818</size><sdkver>31</sdkver><targetSdkVersion>37</targetSdkVersion><added>2026-10-17</added><sig>072f84781cce9171fcb8cd6011d29c4c</sig><permissions>com.sovereignedge.pocketcoach.DYNAMIC_RECEIVER_NOT_EXPORTED_PERMISSION,health.READ_WEIGHT,health.WRITE_EXERCISE,health.WRITE_WEIGHT</permissions><nativecode>arm64-v8a,armeabi-v7a,x86,x86_64</nativecode></package><package><version>0.5.0</version><versioncode>5</versioncode><apkname>com.sovereignedge.pocketcoach_5.apk</apkname><hash type="sha256">8e2234024c51575bcf528a2e8e3e7f39064fc36ffb090b1a3659810516955464</hash><size>3037157</size><sdkver>31</sdkver><targetSdkVersion>37</targetSdkVersion><added>2026-10-17</added><sig>072f84781cce9171fcb8cd6011d29c4c</sig><permissions>com.sovereignedge.pocketcoach.DYNAMIC_RECEIVER_NOT_EXPORTED_PERMISSION</permissions><nativecode>arm64-v8a,armeabi-v7a,x86,x86_64</nativecode></package><package><version>0.4.0</version><versioncode>4</versioncode><apkname>com.sovereignedge.pocketcoach_4.apk</apkname><hash type="sha256">062c42126cac02a40f5149718cd189783482a633c68242b5a8e0ce2f62b1b1b0</hash><size>3020941</size><sdkver>31</sdkver><targetSdkVersion>37</targetSdkVersion><added>2026-10-17</added><sig>072f84781cce9171fcb8cd6011d29c4c</sig><permissions>com.sovereignedge.pocketcoach.DYNAMIC_RECEIVER_NOT_EXPORTED_PERMISSION</permissions><nativecode>arm64-v8a,armeabi-v7a,x86,x86_64</nativecode></package><package><version>0.3.0</version><versioncode>3</versioncode><apkname>com.sovereignedge.pocketcoach_3.apk</apkname><hash type="sha256">7b18768b98901851ba9bdcea5a917a6307d7e52a6caad26ae88ac042ec218cff</hash><size>3004557</size><sdkver>31</sdkver><targetSdkVersion>37</targetSdkVersion><added>2026-10-16</added><sig>072f84781cce9171fcb8cd6011d29c4c</sig><permissions>com.sovereignedge.pocketcoach.DYNAMIC_RECEIVER_NOT_EXPORTED_PERMISSION</permissions><nativecode>arm64-v8a,armeabi-v7a,x86,x86_64</nativecode></package><package><version>0.2.0</version><versioncode>2</versioncode><apkname>com.sovereignedge.pocketcoach_2.apk</apkname><hash type="sha256">0995c87dda9f74d4362fe55fade26495bcea574c43024ff80d69623b2b0224f1</hash><size>2971185</size><sdkver>31</sdkver><targetSdkVersion>37</targetSdkVersion><added>2026-10-16</added><sig>072f84781cce9171fcb8cd6011d29c4c</sig><permissions>com.sovereignedge.pocketcoach.DYNAMIC_RECEIVER_NOT_EXPORTED_PERMISSION</permissions><nativecode>arm64-v8a,armeabi-v7a,x86,x86_64</nativecode></package><package><version>0.1.0</version><versioncode>1</versioncode><apkname>com.sovereignedge.pocketcoach_1.apk</apkname><hash type="sha256">1f9477b44c8329ccec4765a1a5c3ab84cd663508f8aaf99025e586b0bac289be</hash><size>2971181</size><sdkver>31</sdkver><targetSdkVersion>37</targetSdkVersion><added>2026-10-16</added><sig>072f84781cce9171fcb8cd6011d29c4c</sig><permissions>com.sovereignedge.pocketcoach.DYNAMIC_RECEIVER_NOT_EXPORTED_PERMISSION</permissions><nativecode>arm64-v8a,armeabi-v7a,x86,x86_64</nativecode></package></application><application id="com.pocketconcierge"><id>com.pocketconcierge</id><added>2026-10-13</added><lastupdated>2026-10-13</lastupdated><name>Pocket Concierge</name><summary>Offline viewer for self-contained HTML travel itineraries, with Claude</summary><desc>Pocket Concierge keeps your travel itineraries on the phone as single HTML files and shows them offline.

* Library of itineraries imported with the file picker, &quot;Open with&quot;, or Share from Chrome, Drive, Claude or a file manager
* Each itinerary keeps its own checklist progress (localStorage, scoped per file) across restarts; pull down to reload
* Directions links open natively in Google Maps; other links open in their own apps
* Generate with Claude: describe a trip and get a finished itinerary, unlocked once you add your own Claude API key
* Claude connector: an MCP server on the phone that lets Claude Code or the Claude app on your computer list, read, add and revise itineraries over your VPN (Tailscale) or USB, protected by a token
* Follows system dark mode, edge-to-edge

Everything is stored on the phone. The API key and connector token are encrypted with the Android Keystore.</desc><license>Apache-2.0</license><categories>Navigation</categories><category>Navigation</category><web></web><source>https://github.com/frenchtoastbig7-ux/pocket-concierge</source><tracker>https://github.com/frenchtoastbig7-ux/pocket-concierge/issues</tracker><author>Sovereign Edge Inc.</author><marketversion></marketversion><marketvercode>2</marketvercode><antifeatures>NonFreeNet</antifeatures><package><version>1.1.0</version><versioncode>2</versioncode><apkname>com.pocketconcierge_2.apk</apkname><hash type="sha256">a3da7d89f3bcb2f8f52c2e320fcd79d031793eb5aa32eb9275c027c0feb2162b</hash><size>8241647</size><sdkver>26</sdkver><targetSdkVersion>37</targetSdkVersion><added>2026-10-13</added><sig>f74837f13724392913a54f3d37ccafb8</sig><permissions>ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE,FOREGROUND_SERVICE,FOREGROUND_SERVICE_SPECIAL_USE,INTERNET,POST_NOTIFICATIONS,com.pocketconcierge.DYNAMIC_RECEIVER_NOT_EXPORTED_PERMISSION</permissions><nativecode>arm64-v8a,armeabi-v7a,x86,x86_64</nativecode></package></application><application id="com.sovereignedge.pocketpantry"><id>com.sovereignedge.pocketpantry</id><added>2026-10-13</added><lastupdated>2026-10-15</lastupdated><name>Pocket Pantry</name><summary>Pantry inventory, barcode grocery cart, shopping list and Claude recipes</summary><desc>Pocket Pantry keeps track of the food in your household and what it costs to replace it. Built for the Pixel 10 Pro and Pro XL.

* Pantry inventory organised by storage location (Pantry, Counter, Fridge, Freezer or your own) with quantities, expiry dates and low-stock warnings
* Cart: pick your grocery store, scan items as they go in the cart and watch the running total with tax. Prices are remembered per store, and finishing a trip can add everything to the pantry
* Shopping list that ticks itself off as you scan, and takes low-stock items or a recipe's missing ingredients in bulk
* Recipes and meal plans from Claude, unlocked once you add your own Claude API key. Claude is told what you have and what is expiring; replies can be saved and their missing ingredients sent to the list
* Light, dark or system theme with Material You colours

Everything is stored on the phone. The API key is encrypted with the Android Keystore. Barcodes are read on-device with ML Kit's bundled model (no Play Services); unknown barcodes are looked up on Open Food Facts and cached.</desc><license>Apache-2.0</license><categories>Sports &amp; Health</categories><category>Sports &amp; Health</category><web></web><source>https://github.com/frenchtoastbig7-ux/pocket-pantry</source><tracker>https://github.com/frenchtoastbig7-ux/pocket-pantry/issues</tracker><author>Sovereign Edge Inc.</author><marketversion></marketversion><marketvercode>13</marketvercode><antifeatures>NonFreeDep,NonFreeNet</antifeatures><package><version>0.4.2</version><versioncode>13</versioncode><apkname>com.sovereignedge.pocketpantry_13.apk</apkname><hash type="sha256">bee1545315ad46a9dc2879ead7489411be6b1ab217a4c13a9da01fe50bf4275f</hash><size>35249187</size><sdkver>31</sdkver><targetSdkVersion>37</targetSdkVersion><added>2026-10-15</added><sig>e5b021ecbb8b1265d8b9ccbffc472513</sig><permissions>ACCESS_LOCAL_NETWORK,ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE,ACCESS_WIFI_STATE,CAMERA,CHANGE_WIFI_MULTICAST_STATE,FOREGROUND_SERVICE,FOREGROUND_SERVICE_SPECIAL_USE,INTERNET,POST_NOTIFICATIONS,RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED,com.sovereignedge.pocketpantry.DYNAMIC_RECEIVER_NOT_EXPORTED_PERMISSION</permissions><nativecode>arm64-v8a</nativecode></package><package><version>0.4.1</version><versioncode>12</versioncode><apkname>com.sovereignedge.pocketpantry_12.apk</apkname><hash type="sha256">554cdda62e6c3a10be55aac2811711c69ab0f53993aa68f86f4379965693009b</hash><size>35248647</size><sdkver>31</sdkver><targetSdkVersion>37</targetSdkVersion><added>2026-10-15</added><sig>e5b021ecbb8b1265d8b9ccbffc472513</sig><permissions>ACCESS_LOCAL_NETWORK,ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE,ACCESS_WIFI_STATE,CAMERA,CHANGE_WIFI_MULTICAST_STATE,FOREGROUND_SERVICE,FOREGROUND_SERVICE_SPECIAL_USE,INTERNET,POST_NOTIFICATIONS,RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED,com.sovereignedge.pocketpantry.DYNAMIC_RECEIVER_NOT_EXPORTED_PERMISSION</permissions><nativ